   176	  --extra-certificates evidence/round2-uniform/content-322-332222/certificate.json.gz \
   177	  --output evidence/round2-uniform/parent-independent-check.json
   178	```
   179	
   180	The checker reconstructs Serre spaces with the independent tensor implementation, reconstructs all affine lowering entries by associative-word deletion, checks each exact polynomial identity and positivity claim, checks all stabilizer mappings and lower-degree dependencies, rejects altered determinant constants and omitted coverage cells, and binds the exercised certificates and sources by SHA-256. It refuses to overwrite an existing receipt.
